		(at 69.996815 38.921104 90)
		(descr "Bourns CSS4J-4026 4-terminal metal-strip current sense resistor (10.06 x 6.60 mm). Pads 1,4 current; 2,3 sense. Inner geometry from the Bourns datasheet recommended pad layout (7.30 mm overall, 5.60 mm force pad, 0.80 mm gaps and sense width, 10.40 mm across the sense arms). The datasheet draws the force pads and sense traces continuing outward; the 7.20 mm force-pad outer edge and the 2.1 mm sense-leg stub are layout choices. https://www.bourns.com/docs/product-datasheets/css4j-4026.pdf")
